architecture 左の外側を回る線

group web as 画面 [note: 利用者が触る所]
  box top as トップ
  box order as 注文画面
end

group server as サーバー [note: 要求を受ける所]
  box api as API
end

group work as 処理 [note: 裏で動く所]
  box sum as 集計
  box notice as 通知
end

group store as 保存 [note: 記録を残す所]
  box log as 記録
end

step 結果を返す
  api -> order

step 記録を残す
  sum -> log
  api -> log
